# BVT: Spark boots and paints its chrome -- toolbar, 3D viewport with the
# default cube, outliner, camera panel, status bar (SOLID | 1 obj | 12 faces).
#
# Spark writes pixels STRAIGHT to the GOP framebuffer rather than driving the
# GPU rasterizer, and codex-vm only synced its shadow buffer for guests that
# announce a frame (rasterizer / VBE / UEFI). Spark was therefore invisible:
# black window, empty screenshot, frames=0, no error anywhere.

boot 8000
settle 1500
